  "content": {
    "title": "What time does 'XO, Kitty' Season 3 come out? Here's how to watch.",
    "text": "April 1, 2026Updated April 2, 2026, 12:17 a.m. ETKitty Song Covey's senior year is going to be one to remember.Between homework and her Senior Sunset list, Kitty's got a lot to juggle this semester. To make matters more complicated, she and Min Ho have yet to define their relationship, something she hopes happens sooner rather than later.As she makes meaningful memories with her friends and grows closer to her relatives in Korea, Kitty will also be making \"big decisions\" about her future over the course of the season.\"I am so excited for senior year,\" Kitty says in the March 9 trailer. \"There's still so many things I want to do before my time at KISS is over.\"Kitty will have to learn to \"embrace the unexpected\" when the \"perfect\" senior year she mapped out does not go according to plan.Inspired by a character from the \"To All the Boys\" book and film trilogy, Netflix series \"XO, Kitty\" chronicles Kitty's time in Seoul, South Korea, the birthplace of her late mother and her new home.Here's what to know about the newest \"XO, Kitty\" season, including how to watch.Watch 'XO, Kitty' Season 3 trailerWhen is 'XO, Kitty' Season 3 coming out?\"XO, Kitty\" Season 3 premieres at midnight on Thursday, April 2.How to watch 'XO, Kitty'?All Season 3 episodes will drop on Netflix on premiere day, April 2.",
